{"data": [{"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-11-14T07:49:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121510875747987724"], "id": "2121510875747987724", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2098426844244779009", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121510694000726177", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@vikasjkn No single ranking fits all, but recent hands-on reviews and benchmarks put them roughly like this for general task reliability:\n\n1. OpenAI Dots\n2. Meta Muse\n3. Claude Duet\n4. Grok Bot\n5. Gemini Spark\n6. Microsoft Autopilot\n7. OpenClaw\n8. Hermes Agent\n9. n8n/Nod\n\nDots led", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2121510875747987724"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2121492388044509184"]}, "author_id": "1697114261468643328", "created_at": "2026-11-14T06:36:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121492394277233151"], "id": "2121492394277233151", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 670, "like_count": 17, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 5}, "text": "\ud83d\udea8 BREAKING: SIERRA JUST RELEASED POPPY 1.0. IS KYA THE NEXT CRITICAL LAYER OF THE AI ECONOMY? \ud83e\udd16\ud83d\udc38\n\nNovember 13, 2026.\n\nhttps://t.co/ZBF53pOMTj\n\nSierra officially releases Personal Agent Protocol (Poppy) 1.0.\n\nAnd the scale is already significant:\n\n\ud83d\udd25 @Shopify enables Poppy https://t.co/dsHIM3WSqF", "url": "https://x.com/genrih99999/status/2121492394277233151"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2121436387308183552"]}, "author_id": "148213141", "created_at": "2026-11-14T02:55:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121436922551939109"], "id": "2121436922551939109", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 41, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "1/7 I built a Meta Muse Space for making sourdough so I can work out when I can leave home. Think of it like a timer microsite but personalised to your preference and the multiple steps required by the recipe. @Meta @alexandr_wang https://t.co/fgEccpsucJ", "url": "https://x.com/techknew/status/2121436922551939109"}, {"author_id": "25629082", "created_at": "2026-11-14T02:38:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121432607346807098"], "id": "2121432607346807098", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 353, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I\u2019m just one guy with a phone and meta muse.\n\nI\u2019ve built:\n\nhttps://t.co/WcyXYJMaq9\nhttps://t.co/vPqBR9Qgdh\nhttps://t.co/wFw4rtnRKW\nhttps://t.co/fUqWIF4DC0\n\nAnd more to come. One person can build a nice income resource with very little.", "url": "https://x.com/blueslesson/status/2121432607346807098"}, {"author_id": "515106521", "created_at": "2026-11-13T20:08:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121334498034151818"], "id": "2121334498034151818", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3142611731", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121261221491986458", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@0xParam @Meta @Muse Decks built only from what you're studying stick so much better than random facts. I'd let the AI draft cards and then rewrite each one in your own words, you'll remember the rewritten ones far better.", "url": "https://x.com/NabhaniMehdi/status/2121334498034151818"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2121279348720234496"]}, "author_id": "274770016", "created_at": "2026-11-13T17:07:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121288972382912842"], "id": "2121288972382912842", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 7, "impression_count": 730, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Claude Duet Won Me Over. Best AI Personal Assistant?\n\nMy latest podcast with @theaaron breaks down:\n\n- The AI Personal Assistant Battle: Claude Duet vs Meta Muse vs Grok Bot vs ChatGPT Dots\n- Why Claude Duet is now my daily driver\n- The jobs I hand off to Duet\n- How this replaced https://t.co/VSrsGN8Zvv", "url": "https://x.com/ryan_doser13/status/2121288972382912842"}, {"author_id": "1563266793900474368", "created_at": "2026-11-13T13:30:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121234125721927979"], "id": "2121234125721927979", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 23, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "META MUSE EMBER COSTS $0.10 PER MILLION INPUT TOKENS. Output is $0.50.\n\nIt came out on November 9 and is built for the small, repeated steps inside agent workflows: tool calls, data extraction, routing, parsing long documents. It reads up to 1M tokens and accepts images.", "url": "https://x.com/klaivor/status/2121234125721927979"}, {"author_id": "373800245", "created_at": "2026-11-13T13:13:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121230090365260119"], "id": "2121230090365260119", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1163430424233877505", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 48, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121097681476952546", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@hztgr Max are we going to see parallel work from Meta or are we seeing Conductor being built into the Meta/Muse IDE solution?", "url": "https://x.com/Jborgwing/status/2121230090365260119"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2121223178697723904"]}, "author_id": "1963439247362289664", "created_at": "2026-11-13T12:48:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121223645473485153"], "id": "2121223645473485153", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Connected @awscloud  infrastructure to @Meta Muse AI for Recon AI.\n\nAutomated snapshots with Boto3 and S3, enabling AI to identify underutilized EC2 instances and suggest optimizations.\n\nEarly MVP, built for smarter cloud decisions.\n\nOpen source: https://t.co/j11UpYkN8I\n\n#Cloud https://t.co/kjdoMsrJB9", "url": "https://x.com/anubhavbuildz/status/2121223645473485153"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2121213588580741120"]}, "author_id": "1466801151253401605", "created_at": "2026-11-13T12:09:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121213975769604136"], "id": "2121213975769604136", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 91, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Meta is quietly changing the way we think about AI assistants. And I find this direction much more interesting than another chatbot update.\n\nMeet Spaces, a new feature for Meta's Muse agents.\n@Muse\n\nThe idea is surprisingly simple. Instead of having one endless conversation with https://t.co/s1LhUBwnXz", "url": "https://x.com/AlexYakovlevvv/status/2121213975769604136"}, {"author_id": "2107543383816163328", "created_at": "2026-11-13T11:43:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121207445930582362"], "id": "2121207445930582362", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2155231292", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121183165557690456", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@itsjankoenig Grok has practically been down since Halloween, when Elon nerfed usage. I transitioned to Meta Muse, Claude, and tried my hand at Hermes... Hermes was not it for me \u2620\ufe0f. Diversification helps when one service goes down, or cuts usage.", "url": "https://x.com/goto_core/status/2121207445930582362"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2121177897134338048"]}, "author_id": "1610523165696098305", "created_at": "2026-11-13T09:46:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121177932161065327"], "id": "2121177932161065327", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Had claude built a portfolio tracker, and now i am \"hosting\" it on meta muse spaces and recording my transaction on it. Fully free and is optimized to work with muse. \n\nCheck it out here: https://t.co/22UYxURECR\n\nJust need to paste the prompt inside your muse to get started. https://t.co/aKW7k0vDrp", "url": "https://x.com/AxiaMil02/status/2121177932161065327"}, {"author_id": "1614111274396418049", "created_at": "2026-11-13T05:29:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121113256467333297"], "id": "2121113256467333297", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Got a Meta Muse invite code with spots left? Don't let them go to waste. Share it for free on MuseKu so people still hunting can use it. Rewards follow Muse's official rules.\n\nI built MuseKu: https://t.co/t3hU5baodJ\n\n#MetaMuse", "url": "https://x.com/zhaojianming40/status/2121113256467333297"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2121111242572259328", "3_2121111278991314944", "3_2121111307789430784"]}, "author_id": "1120779287504678912", "created_at": "2026-11-13T05:23:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121111589923479721"], "id": "2121111589923479721", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 324, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\ud83d\udd25\u2615 The This Is Fine Trade\n@chamath @DavidSacks @dhh @DowdEdward \n\nThe room is on fire. Export controls. Federal AI bans. A US\u2013China race over chips, models and who gets to build on what. And the market is sitting at the table, sipping coffee, saying \u201cthis is fine.\u201d\n\nHere\u2019s my https://t.co/psyCYxiyw9", "url": "https://x.com/niccolox/status/2121111589923479721"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2121107054580703232"]}, "author_id": "1120779287504678912", "created_at": "2026-11-13T05:08:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121107832062009438"], "id": "2121107832062009438", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 562, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "AI Models Risk-Adjusted ROI Matrix\n@DowdEdward @dsmiley411 @chadwahl @dhh \nThe cheapest AI model isn\u2019t the cheapest choice.\nPrice in geopolitical risk, USG vs. CCP, and the ranking flips:\n\u2022 Mistral Large 4: $727 per coding point\n\u2022 DeepSeek: $2,021\n\u2022 GPT-6 Astra: $9,116\nFor https://t.co/6GvT9RX1Hs", "url": "https://x.com/niccolox/status/2121107832062009438"}, {"article": {"title": "Pangram AI Detection: What Is Known, What Has Been Tested, and What Its Verdicts Can Establish"}, "author_id": "935913725743194113", "created_at": "2026-11-13T03:15:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121079578081058907"], "id": "2121079578081058907", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 813, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/yXEKzavQh5", "url": "https://x.com/crystalwizard/status/2121079578081058907"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2121071228374966272"]}, "author_id": "1130601604418347008", "created_at": "2026-11-13T02:46:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121072276086866303"], "id": "2121072276086866303", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1130601604418347008", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 4816, "like_count": 17, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121072270743400936", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "e. Call &amp; Letter\n\nDictating Deal Terms \u2013 Pricing, Duration &amp; Structure:\n\nTo give an idea of how favorable the multi-year demand backdrop currently is, deal size and duration both continued to rise despite NBIS introducing new ways to add short-term capacity. They\u2019re dictating https://t